window.products.push({"id":227002,"name":"mDesign Microfiber Polyester Bathroom Rug, Non-Slip Bath Mat, Plush Bath Rug for Bath, Shower, Tub - Water Absorbent, Machine Washable - Hydra Collect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711varM+k-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"mDesign helps you add subtle style and a whole lot of comfort to your bathroom floors with their Microfiber Bathroom Rugs. Made of super-soft microfiber polyester, the super soft rugs are highly absorbent, keeping your bathroom floors clean and dry. Non-slip backings keep the rugs in place, giving you a secure place to stand when getting in or out of the shower or tub or at the bathroom vanity. Available in different sizes and shapes to fit your needs, find the rug or set that works best for your home. mDesign - Solutions for Home. Solutions for Life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711varM+k-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B07N97PN47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N97PN47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N97PN47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227003,"name":"Petites Ecoles by Sylvie Demers, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-jVp14zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an abstract arrangement or yellow, blue, purple and white shapes. Sylvie has always been mesmerized by color. Her world is light and full of happy surprises. Living in the Greater Montreal area of Canada, she has illustrated multiple book covers for the Presses de l'Universite du Quebec. In 2011 she joined the COLOUR lovers community and ever since has been designing pattern templates that are youthful and fresh. In 2012 she won the Gelaskins \"Become Our New Artist\" contest. Watercolor and acrylic paints help her to express her optimism and inner spontaneity. She enjoys learning new techniques and exploring her creativity. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-jVp14zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B073ZPZ7J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073ZPZ7J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073ZPZ7J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
