window.products.push({"id":227012,"name":"bliss & co.\"Pin the Pacifier\", Baby Shower Party Games, Gender Reveal Stickers Included, 21 x 28 Poster, 24 Stickers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UHk3U-JyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our \"Pin the Pacifier\" baby shower game is a modern spin on the childhood classic \"Pin the Tail on the Donkey\". It's sure to provide endless fun for your baby shower or gender reveal party. WHAT'S INCLUDED ✔ (1) High Quality 21\" x 28\" Pin the Pacifier / Gender Reveal Game Set ✔ (24) Reusable Vinyl Pacifier Stickers ✔ (1) \"It's a Boy\" & (1) \"It's a Girl\" Gender Reveal Sticker ✔  (1) Girls Headbow Sticker ✔ (1) Fabric Blindfold HOW TO PLAY ① Attach the game poster to any wall and customize with included stickers to make it gender specific or keep it neutral. ② Line the player up to five feet from the game poster. ③ Cover player's eyes with the blindfold. ④ Give player a few spins, and direct player towards the game poster with one pacifier sticker. The winner is the player who gets closest to the baby's mouth Warning: Not responsible for dizzy game players or baby shower guests laughing so hard they fall to the floor. Most importantly, don't forget the game set can also be used to reveal to your guests the baby's gender with the included \"It's a Boy\" or \"It's a Girl\" stickers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UHk3U-JyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bliss & co.","source_asin":"B07S1KLZH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1KLZH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1KLZH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
