window.products.push({"id":227014,"name":"Pixel Art Cinema The Belafonte - Steve Zissou's Ship (24\" x 36\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qlIn0DZIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This large scale print is none other than The Belafonte from Wes Anderson’s The Life Aquatic with Steve Zissou. Faithfully recreated in pixel-perfect form, the boat features nearly everything seen in the masterful scene from The Life Aquatic in which Steve tells us about his boat, The Belafonte. FUN FACTS: The tune of the song played during this scene is in fact taken from a reversed version of another soundtrack, that of Wes Anderson’s The Royal Tenenbaums. The cross section from the film, which this print is based on was 150 feet long and 40 feet high. The film is rumoured to have originated from a single image that Wes had in mind, that of the cross section of a boat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qlIn0DZIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pixel Art Cinema","source_asin":"B01AQCSXEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AQCSXEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AQCSXEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
