window.products.push({"id":227088,"name":"European Leather Photo Album Holds 300 4x6\" Photos - Archival Quality, Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mNviSafIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Store your photos and record notes about your memories in this European Bonded Leather Photo Album. The album holds 300 4x6\" photos and can accommodate 4x12\" panoramic prints. Utilizing archival and photo safe paper, photos are protected in an Acid-free, lignin-free, and PVC-free environment. Within the album, photos can be displayed horizontally or vertically for better placement and easier viewing. The album has storage for 2 photo CDs as well as negatives. An included index page is handy for noting where pictures are stored in the album.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mNviSafIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pioneer","source_asin":"B0039VAJEY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0039VAJEY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0039VAJEY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
