window.products.push({"id":227104,"name":"Gotham Steel 4 Qt Air Fryer, Small Air Fryer with Nonstick Copper Coating, Oil Free Healthy Air Fryer with Rapid Air Technology, Easy to Use Temperatu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QpAf8BU6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Now there’s a healthier way to fry all your favorite foods! Once again, Daniel Green has not only made cooking easy and fun but most importantly healthier with his Gotham Steel Air Fryer. The delicious way to fry any food without using oils, fats or butter. With its amazing new technology that using cyclic circulation of superheated air making it crispy on the outside yet moist and tender on the inside. And it’s easy to use just place food in the basket, close it and set the timer. In just minutes healthy food that is less fat and with less calories Your Gotham Steel Air Fryer is not only for frying, you can also make yummy pot roast, mouthwatering nachos and so much more. Its dishwasher safe and can set up to 400 degrees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QpAf8BU6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOTHAM STEEL","source_asin":"B07DLD9XJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DLD9XJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DLD9XJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227105,"name":"Boho Abstract Throw Pillow Covers Set of 2 Modern Sun Mid Century Pillowcases Yellow Circle Line Geometric Couch Cushion Covers Nature Landscape Minim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61szRfjBW1L._AC_SL1489_.jpg","description":"Material: The boho throw pillows are made of high quality durable polyester, soft, comfort and beauty coexist,improve the skin-friendly nature of the fabric while keeping the pattern clear and bright. Size&Package: Each package includes pack of 2 modern abstract throw pillows and each of cushion cover measures 18x18inch/ 46x46cm(1-2cm deviation),No Insert or Filler!!! Features: One sides printing of abstract sun rainbow geometric decorative pillow covers with exclusive designs bring you wonderful experience at home, use these pillow covers to change your home decor easily by reusing your own pillows. Decoration: Boho cushion covers suit perfectly for living room, bedroom, book store, home, kitchen, bedding, patio,coffee shop, dorm, office, camper, camping, outdoor indoor etc Decorations. Hidden Zipper&Washiing Mode: Bottom invisible zipper looks more tidy and clearly. Please fold the pillow insert in half and carefully insert into the flower decoration cushion covers.Machine washable in cold water, delicate cycle, dry flat or hang to dry, do not bleach, do not dry at high temperatures, do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61szRfjBW1L._AC_SL1489_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tritard","source_asin":"B09NN32C4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN32C4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN32C4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227106,"name":"Bamboo Universal Knife Block - Extra Large Two-tiered Slotless Wooden Knife Stand, Organizer & Holder - Convenient Safe Storage for Large & Small Kniv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LyVw-w8PL._AC_SL1444_.jpg","description":"SAVE SPACE AND REDUCE HASSLE WITH UNIVERSAL STORAGE DESIGN: Fit any kind of knife into the slotless Ettu Knife Block. Our flexible, black plastic rods move around to fit knives of any shape or size into the block at any angle. Stop trying to squeeze knives into predefined slots of a bin or drawer holder - simply insert them in as you please and get back to cooking. Overall dimensions are: 10 inches high by 4.6 inches wide by 7.7 inches deep. TWO TIERS FOR KITCHEN AND STEAK KNIVES: The extra large top tier has 3.8 inch by 3.8 inch opening, can fit kives up to 8 inches in length, and is suitable for paring, bread, carving, utility, and butcher's knives! The second tier has a 3.7 inch by 1.1 inch opening, and is designed to hold up to 6 steak knives that are up to 5 inches in length. (Note: This knife block does not include knives. Knives with blades that are the maximum length or beyond may stick out above the bristles.) FLEXIBLE FOOD-GRADE PLASTIC RODS KEEP KNIVES SHARP: Our BPA free, food grade plastic rods / bristles won't chip or dull your knives. They move around to fit knives when inserted or removed. This design keeps your knives sharp, and won't cause abrasions like traditional slotted wood knife blocks. STYLISH BAMBOO CASING: The outer shell is made of 100 percent finished, eco-friendly premium bamboo, and looks smart and sophisticated in both traditional and modern kitchens. This sturdy, heavy wooden casing won't tip over easily, and keeps both you and your knives safe - no need to worry about exposed blades from metal magnetic strip knife holders. EASY TO WASH & CLEAN: The long black plastic rods are removable - simply push out the block from the bottom. The bristles are easy to clean: they can be hand washed with warm, soapy water. Please avoid heat drying as that will reduce the adhesive affixing the rods together. The bamboo shell should be hand washed; additional polish may be needed after multiple washings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LyVw-w8PL._AC_SL1444_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ETTU Kitchen","source_asin":"B07ZPYGGSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZPYGGSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZPYGGSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227107,"name":"Malden Infiniti Double Matted Triple Wall Frame for 11-by-14-Inch Picture, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPfAQzvPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With their blend of crisp coloring and tasteful matting, the Infiniti frames from Malden showcase favorite photos in contemporary style for composed, timeless display. Framed in black metal casing with slender dimensions and a lustrous surface, the frames come with a pre-cut double mat, adding subtle depth and elegant finish to photos. Lovely with black-and-whites, close-ups, family portraits, or colorful vacation memories, the frames are available in a range of sizes and layouts. Grouping them together creates a visually harmonious variety that can be added to or rearranged with ease. This version of the Infiniti frame offers the option of featuring one 11-by-14-inch photo with the mat or a larger 16-by-20-inch pic without the mat. The classic design works equally well with a studio portrait or a landscape shot. Designed for vertical or horizontal display, the frame measures 16-3/4 by 1-1/4 by 20-3/4 inches and arrives ready to hang.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPfAQzvPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Malden","source_asin":"B002KE92JY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002KE92JY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002KE92JY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
