window.products.push({"id":227326,"name":"Disney Mickey Mouse Backpack Set ~ 3 Pc Bundle with Lunch Box, Backpack and Stickers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X6ZMY666L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Your child will be ready for any adventure with this Disney Mickey Mouse backpack and Disney Mickey Mouse lunch box bundle for kids! This Disney Mickey Mouse Clubhouse backpack with lunch box set for kids features colorful artwork depicting everyone's favorite mouse! Disney Mickey Mouse insulated lunch kit measures 7\"x9\" and has a handle for an easy carry. Deluxe closure and insulation will keep food and drinks cold for hours. Disney Mickey Mouse backpack measures 16 inches by 12 inches by 4 inches. Just the right size for school children and their books. Adjustable padded shoulder straps. Top loop for hanging. High quality and durable construction. Officially licensed Disney Mickey Mouse products featuring colorful artwork of Mickey Mouse and Friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X6ZMY666L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Disney Shop","source_asin":"B089NDLLF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NDLLF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NDLLF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227327,"name":"LURVUO Shower Caddy Shower Organizer,3Pack No Drilling Large Capacity Rustproof Adhesive Bathroom Organizer for Bathroom Storage&Kitchen,White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fDvdffWpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>✔【3-Pack Large Storage Capacity&Widened Fence Design】:Our shower caddy set includes 2 large shower shelves, 1 soap holder and 3 adhesives. The large capacity shower shelf can store all of your bath supplies like shampoo, hair conditioner, body wash, cream, and other items.Also,the fences of these shower organizers are widened to prevent the bottle from falling. Our shower organizer suitable for bathroom, kitchen, tool room, etc and not only can keep everything organized but also help you add-on charm to your home.</p> <p>✔【Strong and Powerful Load-bearing】:Our shower caddies provide an upgraded version of transparent non-marking adhesive with superior stability which has a length of 27cm and longer than most products on the market, it allow each shower rack to hold 40 pounds of products and secures firmly via durable, traceless adhesive that won’t damage your shower wall. REMOVE GUIDE: Use a hairdryer to heat the sticker, tear it off easily when heat enough.</p> <p>✔【Easy Installation & Suitable for Various Walls】:No tools or drilling is required. Our shower shelves simply stick adhesives, just 5 mins, no damage to the walls and we believe its elegant design can bring you a comfortable experience.Note:it suitable for smooth tile, marble, tempered glass, wood wall, and solid metal,but wallpaper wall, stucco wall, lime wall, or the concrete wall is not recommended.</p> <p>✔【Premium Material & Whole Hollow Design】:Built with high quality metal material and high-temperature baking paint process, each shower shelf is durable, rustproof, waterproof, and scratch-proof. A hollow design allows for good ventilation, which help drain and dry fast.</p> <p>✔【Package Contents&Satisfaction Guarantee】: 2 different size shower racks, 1*soap holder,3 *adhesive (NOTE: If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, our customer service will reply within 24 hours.)</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fDvdffWpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LURVUO","source_asin":"B0BTYSY8QT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYSY8QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYSY8QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227328,"name":"Sisitano 2in1 Travel French Press Coffee Maker, Portable 11.8 oz Tumbler Coffee French Press for Ground Coffee & Tea Leaves; Iced Coffee, Cold Brew Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jgi2NOi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adventures with Coffee to Go! It's a tumbler and a french coffee press rolled into one neat package. Making it an easy to carry, leak-proof, drink safe, insulated coffee thermos, that can be used for ground coffee or loose leaf tea. Cold brew coffee maker, hot tea infuser, and even infused water maker. Effortless for any time & where! Despite being made of 3 major components, this nifty little travel mug can fit into most backpacks without trouble. At 9oz it's ultra-lightweight. Sturdy too! The main tumbler body is durable and has a non-slip sleeve for extra safety & comfort. It can hold 20-25 g of coffee/tea with 10-11 oz of water for a rich brew made just for you. When in use, there's a vacuum seal that helps lock in the heat. But! Its best brewing time when hot is 3-4 minutes. Travel Mug & Tea Pot?! Leave the bulky espresso maker, tea set & giant k-cup brewer at home. Even without a tea cup or coffee mug you can enjoy your favorite brew straight from the tumbler. It's simple, just great coffee grounds, hot water, and your very own french press coffee maker designed for easy carrying. To keep the coffee hot for longer just firmly close the snap-lock cap. Boiling hot water will only lose its heat by a bit when you leave it sealed for an hour. A Gift Worth Sharing - Our Portable French Press can be a great addition to any budding coffee aficionado’s set for brewing coffee. Especially since it's safe for everyday use. Use it to infuse water, as a tea press & for that jet setter in your life, be the perfectly sized travel coffee mug that is 100% spill-proof. You're Helping Make An Impact - As our saying goes - \"When it's time for coffee.\" Your insulated french press can be brought with you for coffee anywhere and anytime. No need to worry about pods or capsules wasting away! Used coffee grounds and used tea leaves can be used for a multitude of other projects like fertilizer for your garden, as a natural scrub, or even for dyes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jgi2NOi7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sisitano","source_asin":"B07DQGT817","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DQGT817","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DQGT817","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
