window.products.push({"id":227419,"name":"CODOGOY Grease Cup for Blackstone Stove with Stainless Steel Griddle Spatula Holder, Grease Drip Catcher Pan with 12 Pack Drip Pan Liners, Grease Catc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orSmhFHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Good partner for Blackstone Griddle Accessories】Package Includes -- 12*Aluminum Drip Pan Liner, 1*Grease Cup, 1*Upgraded Stainless Steel Griddle Spatula Holder. They will save you a lot of time and mess. Let you enjoy the BBQ party cooking! 【Catches Grease & No Mess】Great grease trays, no longer grease everywhere! Not only help your keep away from residual grease, and helps with easy cleanup after cooking and seasoning. 【Upgraded Griddle Spatula Holder】Integrally-molded & seamless. Thickened stainless steel material makes this holder thicker and more durable. Larger size can hold more barbecue tools. Ideal to keep your spatula within reach, give you an arranged cooking space. 【Easy to install】Just need hang this grease cup tray on the back of your Blackstone grill, then, drain the grease and throw it away the liner after using. Our barbecue spatula rack fixed with 2 screws, more stable when using. Just mount on the side ledge of your griddle and start saving space. 【Easy to Clean】Come with 12 Grease Cup Liners. Made of recyclable aluminum trays, making it easy to remove grease from your grill and clean. Before it almost full, take it out, drain the grease then throw away the foil pans. It saves a ton of headaches messing with washing grease cup out. 【Premium Material】Our grease tray made of high quality powder coated steel and 100% recyclable aluminum, eco-friendly rear grease cup liner. Resistant high temperature, durable enough to last a long time. The Griddle Spatula Holder is made of quality stainless steel. With integrally molded, durable and sturdy. 【Grease Catcher Designed for Blackstone Griddle】Drip pan measures 7\" x 3.2\" x 3\", holds 2LB of liquid. Super large capacity. Compatible with the grease cup kit of Blackstone Stove 17’’& 22’’& 28’’& 36’’ series grill griddles replacement part. 【Spatula Holder Fit for All Kinds of Cast Iron Griddle Flat Top Grills】Compatible with Blackstone, Camp Chef, Royal Gourmet and other Cast Iron Griddle Flat Top Grills. Good idea for BBQ teppanyaki cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orSmhFHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CODOGOY","source_asin":"B0B8NPD1K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8NPD1K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8NPD1K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227420,"name":"Threadmill Luxury 100% Cotton Queen Bed-Sheets - 800 Thread Count Jacquard Celine Hotel White, Better Than Egyptian Cotton,4 Pc Striped Bed Set, Damas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xWURP8vHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY, SOFTNESS & COMFORT WITH 100% PURE COTTON JACQUARD CELINE DAMASK SHEETS: Dive into the divine touch of pure cotton with our 800 thread count bedding set. Made using extra long staple cotton yarns, these luxurious sheets have the smoothness and softness of a feather. The 800 threads woven per inch add durability and breathability to the mix, making this bed set the ultimate choice for hot sleepers. The jacquard celine damask sheets bring a hotel-like, modern elegance to your bedroom. PERFECTLY FITTING DEEP POCKET SHEETS WITH ALL-AROUND ELASTIC: Each 4 piece Queen size sheet set which includes 1 flat sheet (92\" W x 104\" L), 1 fitted sheet (60\" W x 80\" L + 16\" deep pocket) and 2 Standard pillowcases (20\" W x 30\" L). With an elasticized deep pocket bottom sheet, you can not only make your bed with ease but also sleep without the worry of bunched up sheets. The seam of these bed sheets and pillowcases also gives them a stylish and elegant look. EASY TO CARE BED LINENS WITH SUPERIOR FINISH & CRAFTSMANSHIP: Bid adieu to the worry of loose fibers with our extra long staple cotton bedding. Each sheet is expertly woven to ensure no pilling and long-lasting strength. This sheet set gets softer and resists fading with every wash, making it completely worth the money. To avoid shrinkage and prevent wrinkles, we recommend machine washing the sheets at room temperature, tumble dry them on low, and folding them immediately after. PERFECT GIFTING CHOICE THAT COMPLEMENTS THE ENTIRE HOME DECOR: Enjoy the ultimate cozy feel of slipping into these luxurious bed sheets. Each sheet has the perfect color that takes your bedroom’s look up a notch by adding these excellent sheets to your bedroom collection. Valentines, christmas, or thanksgiving, these gorgeous bed linens can be the ideal gifting choice for all your near and dear ones. CERTIFIED & SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We take pride in making some of the world’s finest linens while respecting the environment. Our products and practices are free from harmful chemicals, earning the OEKO TEX certification. All these premium sheets are manufactured in a wind and solar energy powered factory. They are packed in a zero-plastic, reusable cotton tote bag and delivered with a 100% satisfaction guarantee, giving you exceptional customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xWURP8vHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B073CX2S2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073CX2S2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073CX2S2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
