window.products.push({"id":227519,"name":"nokoor Popsicle Molds 2 Pcs Silicone Ice Popsicle Maker - BPA Free Easy Release Durable DIY Ice Cream & Cube Pop Molds with 12 Reusable Popsicle Stick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H44tOtt6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍦Reusable Stick🍦 This ice popsicle mold set is equipped with a reusable stick, and the anti-drip device on the sturdy stick can catch the melted ice cream. They are easy to disassemble and clean, and their reusable design helps reduce waste, and you can use them again and again in the refrigerator for years to come. 🍨Food-grade Silicone🍨 This silicone popsicle mold is made of high-quality food-grade silicone (BPA-free and non-toxic), it is soft and durable, will not break or leak, has no sharp edges, and the temperature range is -30 to 240° C. High-quality materials ensure that your diet is healthy. 🧁DIY Experience🧁 This silicone-grade mold can not only make healthy and delicious popsicles and ice cubes for the family and children, but also can experience the fun of DIY with the family and add more fun to our lives. (Homemade popsicles will not have any strange things, such as adding color, chemicals or spices that are harmful to health.) 🍧Multi-function🍧This silicone popsicle mold adopts a folding design, not only a popsicle mold, but also an ice cube mold. Meet your diverse needs. 🍦Easy to Demold and Clean🍦 This silicone ice cream mold can be demolded easily and is completely non-sticky. It is easier to demold than plastic and stainless steel. It can be rinsed directly with water and is dishwasher safe. After taking the popsicle out of the refrigerator, place it in the air for 2-3 minutes, and then easily pull the stick to pop it out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H44tOtt6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nokoor","source_asin":"B09FF44HS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FF44HS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FF44HS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
