window.products.push({"id":227593,"name":"KAHLA Five Senses Coffee Cup 6-3/4 oz, Wonderland Color, 1 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OEfJJFlbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Say it with flowers with the Wonderland décor. Stylised vines in retro-design by Swiss designer Flavia Fleming bring a cheerful mood to the table. The FIVE SENSES cups and mugs are pure and simple in their design. The FIVE SENSES coffee cup is as elegant as it is sure-footed. With its delicate walls and its thin rims it is particularly well-suited for classic filter coffee. Do you love to lend a hand in the kitchen – even if there is not time for a grand meal every day? FIVE SENSES is porcelain for people who enjoy cooking and eating with all their senses. Many clever details surprise with their ingenuity or put a smile on your face. The cups are slightly shifted off-centre on the saucers to allow more space for spoons, sugar cubes and chocolate biscuits. The spoon fits under the lid of the sugar bowl – we call it Sugar loaf. The cut of the plates is slanted – this prevents spills and crumbs on the table but also allows an easier access for knife, fork and spoon. There are beautiful bowls in all proportions and sizes imaginable and baking tins for delicious dishes from the oven. FIVE SENSES was awarded eight international design awards. Kahla porcelain is dishwasher safe and microwave safe. We hope you enjoy our products made in Germany using environmentally and socially sustainable production practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OEfJJFlbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAHLA - PORCELAIN FOR THE SENSES","source_asin":"B005IXFQ0S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005IXFQ0S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005IXFQ0S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227594,"name":"Amulet Black Obsidian Elephant Gemstone Carving Spiritual Protection Powers Pocket or Desk Totem Good Luck Charm with Pouch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gBVT2pFOL._AC_UL1001_.jpg","description":"This is Very Special and Individual Lucky Elephant Gemstone Carving made from Genuine and Natural Black Obsidian Gemstone. This LUCKY Figurine is Good Luck Amulet and Brings Good Luck and Spiritual Protection. ELEPHANT Symbol of Wisdom, Luck, Loyalty. The Elephant considered a STRONG Symbol of LUCK - keep a lucky elephant with you to protect from bad luck and to stimulate good luck for all times. The elephant is probably the MOST POSITIVE Animal Symbol known. The elephant attains old age and with it, wisdom. They are highly revered for their strength and power. See Alternative View for More Details. SPECIAL and NATURAL Powers of Black Obsidian Gemstone: With its Powers Effective in all Chakras, Onyx is a Very Spiritual stone. Its primary function for spiritualists is as a grounding stone that strengthens the connection of the person with the Earth to provide guidance. It is used to end unhappy or bothersome Situations. Onyx is in tune with the Earths energies and balances Yin and Yang. It is grounding stone, Valuable in difficult or confusing times in our lives. Extremely helpful to people who are in the process of \" letting go\" or releasing the past attachments to \"people , places and things. Absorbs and flattens emotional intensity. Helps to smooth out the \"Roller Coaster Ride\" of emotions. Black Obsidian is a Tremendous Strength Provider, especially during times of extreme stress. Onyx is used to Deflect or Absorb the negativity of others, and in that way is a good stone for protection from negative forces and influences. Onyx at one time was more precious than gold, silver, or sapphire because people used it for Self Protection. Onyx Sharpens your senses. As well it Fortifies self confidence and responsibility. Excellent stone for initiating the process of centering and alignment of the total person with a Higher Power. It helps us to absorb whatever energy we need from the Universe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gBVT2pFOL._AC_UL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Amulets","source_asin":"B009FDKYUO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009FDKYUO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009FDKYUO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
