window.products.push({"id":227603,"name":"(2020 New Version) ORIA Mini Bag Sealer, 2 Pack Plastic Bag Resealer, 2 in 1 Heat Sealer and Cutter, Portable Handheld Heat Vacuum Sealers for for Air","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uMPNdEgxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications: ◆Material: ABS  ◆Weight: 218g  ◆Size: 14.8 x 4.3 x 4.8cm Features: ◆Dual-function design: It is not only a sealing machine, but also an unsealing machine.  ◆Hook design: It can be hung when not in use and does not take up space.  ◆Good workmanship: The detachable hook part prevents the heating wire from heating continuously.  ◆Widely used: Suitable for all kinds of plastic bags.  ◆High temperature sealing, easy and trouble-free  ◆Battery: 4 AA alkaline batteries (included)  ◆compact and portable Instructions for use: 1. After the battery is installed, it will not automatically heat up, and it will heat up after pressing down.  2. To install the battery correctly.  3. After the battery is installed, keep pressing for about 3-5 seconds to start heating.  4. Put the bag to be sealed in the middle, according to the thickness of the bag, pull it over for an appropriate time.  5. After use, there is no need to remove the battery, just stick the hook on the seal. Precautions: 1. When the battery power is low, the sealing effect will be affected. Please replace the battery.  2. If you will not use it for a long time, remove the battery. Package Included: 2 x Sealing machine  4 x AA battery  1 x Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uMPNdEgxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORIA","source_asin":"B08NSF519K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NSF519K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NSF519K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
