window.products.push({"id":227619,"name":"Gordon Ramsay by Royal Doulton Oven-to-Tableware Rectangular Roaster, 4-Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bb5HEgkKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Gordon Ramsay by Royal Doulton collection offers a fresh approach to modern table setting by keeping it utterly simple, comfortable and functional. Plates feature a flat cross section to prevent cutlery from sliding and the sauceboat has an exaggerated handle for easy use and a wide spout for easy, non-drip pouring. Gordon's selection of primarily white tones showcases the food itself, which Gordon feels is most appealing to the appetites of diners. Because the entire collection will be used on the dining tables and in the kitchens of Ramsay's London restaurants as well as in his New York City outpost, the London NYC, Ramsay is demanding a new standard of perfection. The Gordon Ramsay by Royal Doulton collection is influenced by Gordon's years of cooking and presenting meals to thousands of new and faithful patrons and he is looking to impress thousands more. Clearly, Gordon has made a terrific impression, his restaurants have been awarded Michelin Stars for Excellence as well as being knighted by England's Queen Elizabeth. Royal Doulton is thrilled to bring Gordon Ramsay's products to life, bringing affordable luxury to consumers everywhere. Amazon.com Roast marinated chicken breasts in this 4-quart rectangular roaster. Chef Gordon Ramsay, renowned for his hot temper as much as for his culinary prowess, designed the roaster for his new line of bakeware in collaboration with Royal Doulton. The roaster moves seamlessly from the oven to the table with a durable construction and its sleek, modular style. The roaster features a nonporous porcelain construction that resists chips, scratches, stains, and odors for years of use. Embossed bands run horizontally around the roaster's sides, providing traction for the chef in transporting dishes in and out of the oven. The user-friendly roaster accommodates freezer, dishwasher, and microwave use, and sustains oven or broiler temperatures up to 482 degrees F. To preserve the roaster's efficacy, avoid dramatic temperature changes and the use of abrasives in cleaning. Do not heat the roaster while empty, nor expose to open flame cooking. For tidy storage, the roaster stacks together with other pieces from Ramsay's bakeware line. A limited two-year warranty covers this item. The roaster measures 15-1/2 by 11-1/2 by 2-4/5 inches and weighs 8 pounds upon shipping. --Jessica Reuling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bb5HEgkKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Doulton","source_asin":"B000PI6B3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000PI6B3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000PI6B3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227620,"name":"Stainless Steel Spiral Wire Whisk - Heavy Duty Coil Sauce & Gravy Whipper - Wooden Handheld Egg Whisks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C35GSMhlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for all yours whisking tasks especially chili, stews and sauces, our heavy-duty whisk ensures constant contact to ensure even mixing while preventing scorching. Creative round shape and spiral way design of gravy whisk makes the whisking and mixing much easier and faster. Try stainless whisk for big bowls of pancake batter, beating eggs and blending a small batch of vinaigrette. Ergonomically designed whipper whisk for excellent balance and control-for a difference you can really feel in the hand. This no rust whisk have strong stainless steel body, custom extra thick frothing wire and wooden handle. Wire whisk built to easily and efficiently eliminate lumps and help create consistency in mixes and batters. Our stainless steel whisk is convenient, sturdy and easy to wash. Whisk wooden nice to hold, easy to employ, and easy to clean. Our long handled whisk is rust resistant, non-stick and easy to clean. This kitchen whisk stainless steel is well-balanced and exceptionally comfortable in your hand. Coil whisk as a nice handheld manual milk frother coffee foamer with the spring blender, easy to create foaming after stirring the coffee milk and more. Our wire whisks ideal for beating sauces, eggs, cream and more. Spiral whisk combines liquid and dry ingredients like eggs and flour effortlessly. Polished stainless steel wires and shape of sauce whisk are perfect for whisking in a small bowl or container. This egg whisk is great for making gravy directly in roasting pans, blend in thickening agents for a creamy alfredo sauce or hollandaise sauce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C35GSMhlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFXDD","source_asin":"B081D7CM36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081D7CM36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081D7CM36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
