window.products.push({"id":227626,"name":"Brite Star 50 Mini Incandescent Teal Green Christmas Lights - 17.3 ft Green Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415r3L2lhdL._AC_.jpg","description":"Incandescent mini lights are still one of the most popular lights on the market. With the variety of colors that they come in, their versatility and low cost, these lights still dominate over any other light type. Add a fun and festive touch to your Christmas tree, banister or doorway with these timeless lights. Product Features:. Color: teal bulbs / green wire. Number of bulbs on string: 50. Bulb size: mini Spacing between each bulb: 4.25\" Lighted length: 17.3'. Total length: 19'. 18\" lead cord. 3\" tail cord Additional Product Features:. Super bright bulbs. UL certified and approved for indoor or outdoor use, however, the light itself is recommended for indoor use only If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit Lights are equipped with a Lamp Lock feature, which makes them replaceable, interchangeable and keeps them from falling out). Comes with replacement bulbs and a spare fuse Contains end-to-end connectors which allow you to connect multiple sets together (not to exceed 210 watts) Wire gauge: 22 120 volts, 60 hertz, 0.17 amps, 20.4 watts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415r3L2lhdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brite Star","source_asin":"B00NUI4W1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NUI4W1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NUI4W1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227627,"name":"Westinghouse Marble Coated Non-Stick Crepé Pan (12.5-inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x4EYXDdLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Westinghouse Marble Coated Non-Stick 12.5-inch Crepé Pan is perfect for making crepés, omelets, pancakes, grilled sandwiches or tortillas. You’ll be amazed by how simple it is to cook on this crepé pan, which is finished with three layers of non-stick marble coating. There’s no need to use butter or oil because food will simply not stick to the marble coating. Easy to clean, either by hand or in the dishwasher, this crepé pan is built with durable forged aluminum and the marble coating on the inside of the pan is superior to chemical non-stick surfaces and won’t peel. The pan has a stay cool silicone handle and a tapered rim to eliminate drips while pouring. The induction compatible bottom helps the pan deliver even heat fast to cook a perfect pancake or crepé every time. Compatible with hot plates, direct heat and induction stoves, this crepé pan will quickly become a favorite in any kitchen. For more than a century, Westinghouse has consistently provided innovative, reliable, high-quality products and customer service. It’s a combination of groundbreaking technology and rock-solid dependability that’s made us one of the world’s most trusted brands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x4EYXDdLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westinghouse","source_asin":"B07D2WB6HF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2WB6HF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2WB6HF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
