window.products.push({"id":227642,"name":"DegGod Ultra Soft Faux Fur Area Rugs, 2 x 3.3 Feet White Fluffy Rectangle Carpet, Plush Modern Indoor Non-Slip Floor Mat for Children Bedroom Living R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71icXdJM+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Not an Animal Product & Super Soft Fabric !!! We love pets as much as you do, that is why, all our rugs are made of synthetic materials, we adopted faux fur, It has a plush look and soft feel, looks great in rooms and feels good between toes. Great Value, Durable and Solid Color Area Rug Suitable for Any Accacion. This super soft furry fur rug can be used as an accent rug in your bedroom or living room, and it works good for that. More applicable Scene: apply to indoor home decor, bedroom, dorm, livingroom, children playroom, girls boys nursery room, dining sitting room, hall, study room, classroom etc. Or covers the yucky carpet that has been there year after year. It's not fancy, it serves your purpose well. Care Instructions: 1. Product comes in an air-sealed bag, it’s normal to see the fibers on the rug is not fluffy and there will be some creases. So please shake it before use and it takes several days to go to its max fluffiness. 2. Please set on the wool mode to wash the rug with the machine, using cold water ( less than 30 degrees ). Add a small amount of mild or all-natural detergent. Shake it to fluff up the faux fur when take out the faux fur item. Note: Do not overstuff washer. 3. Lay rug out or hang to dry naturally without direct heat or sun. Choose a site that's well ventilated for air drying. Brush and fluff up the faux fur, using a care brush with widely spaced metal bristles. 4. The actual color of the product maybe slightly different from the picture color Due to the different monitors and light effects. Product Describe: Shape: Rectangle  Color: Snowy White, Grey  Size: About 2 ft x 3.3 ft ( 60*100cm, 23.6 x 39.4 inches ) , 2.62 ft x 4 ft ( 80*120cm, 31.5 x 47.2 inches ) , 2.62 ft x 5.2 ft ( 80*160cm, 31.5 x 63 inches )  Material: Sponge and artificial fabric rug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71icXdJM+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DegGod","source_asin":"B0912L2GFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912L2GFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912L2GFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
