window.products.push({"id":227662,"name":"Sunlit Vintage Picture Frame 5x7 Inch, Luxury Antique Photo Frames with Glass Front, Photo Display, Tabletop Wall Hanging, Gift Ideas, Black and Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qUHeTXGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As a timeless decoration, this frame showcases beautiful appearance and traditional aesthetic that blends perfectly with any space in any room. These frames suit any room decor including Traditional, Modern, Farmhouse or Contemporary.  The vintage golden finish is a beautiful way to showcase your memories. The antique design give this frame a striking presence in any room. The vintage luxury styling can turn an ordinary print into an extraordinary print. Our Collection is sure to be one of your favorite frames! And this frame fits a 5x7 inches picture.  Our high definition glass allows your pictures to be displayed more clearly than the plastic panel does.  Decorative Photo Frames can be used in both directions and will display easily on your tabletop, counter, desk or shelf. It can also be hung with installed hooks or displayed on a tabletop with the installed easel.  These frames make great gifts for relatives, friends, or co-workers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qUHeTXGML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunlit","source_asin":"B08BHNCKJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHNCKJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHNCKJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227663,"name":"MIDEA MY-CS6004W 15-in-1 6L Stainless Steel Pot Electric Pressure Cooker with Steamer Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gkfn5P6gL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is how you operate the machine. It is very easy. Plug the power cord into wall outlet. Open the lid by turning it counter clockwise. Add materials to the removable stainless inner pot below the \"max\" Mark. Close the lid by turning it clockwise. Select an automatic cooking program by 1) Pressing \"menu\"; and 2) Pressing \"+\" or \"-\" to select program 1 (P01) to 15 (P15). or create your own cooking program by 1) Pressing \"manual setting\"; 2) Pressing \"pressure level\" To chose \"low\", \"medium\" Or \"high\"; and then 3) Pressing \"cooking timer\" And then \"+\" or \"-\" to adjust cooking time. Here you can create endless combination of cooking programs with different cooking pressure and cooking time. Set up \"delay time\" By 1) Pressing \"delay timer\" And 2) Pressing \"+\" or \"-\" to adjust delay time. This is optional. The 24 hr delay timer will make your meal planning very flexible. For instance, you can prepare the cooking at nigh before going to bed for the cooker to cook breakfast the next morning automatically. Wait a few seconds, the LCD will stop blinking, the machine will beep and then start cooking automatically. If you set up delayed cooking, The machine will first counter down the delay time, and then start cooking automatically. During cooking you will not hear any steam because the pressure is automatically control. The cooking is quiet, clean, efficient, and fully automatic. After cooking: The cooker will beep and then automatically enters \"keep warm\". Please note that this cooker has a stainless steel inner pot and lid. All surfaces in contact with food are stainless steel. This is a large Capacity cooker since the inner pot is 6 liter (most cooker is 5 liter). this cooker is UL Certificated and is made exclusively for green living/green electronics As indicated on the color box. Bonus free steamer rack!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gkfn5P6gL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"prepAmeal","source_asin":"B01D7N6BZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D7N6BZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D7N6BZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
