window.products.push({"id":227882,"name":"Mini Dinosaur Silicone Candy molds, Non-Stick Dragon Gummy Bear Mold, 100% Food Grade Gummie Chocolate Ice Cube Gelatin Tray Creates 192 Sweet Snacks(","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pyniy9xsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PURE FOOD GRADE SILICONE MOLDS】Soft and flexible silicone candy mold, BPA Free. NON-STICK and easy to use. Oven, freezer, and dishwasher are safe. Heat resistant up to -40F to 470F(-40℃ to 240℃). 【INCLUDE 4 DIFFERENT DINO SHAPES】Including Triceratops, T-Rex, Stegosaurus, Brontosaurus. Fun dinosaur shapes – make your gummies Jurassic with our 4 pack dinosaur candy molds – this set comes with 4 x 48 cavity trays with 4 droppers. Total of 192 cavities. 【ENJOY HAPPY TIME WITH KIDS】Make healthy snacks with kids. With good detail shapes, children will love them. Make homemade gummy treats perfect for preschoolers, toddlers, and teens with ingredients you can trust. perfect for making fruit gummies, chocolates, vitamin candy, lozenges, and much more! 【PLEASE PAY ATTENTION TO THE SIZE】Dinosaur Molds Size:8*4.8*0.4inch(19.3*11.9*0.8cm),each Dinosaur Size:1.7*2.2inch,each Dinosaur Volume:1.5ml.A great choice for kids' birthday party favors. Pass the “pinch test” which means you won't see white when you pinch our mold. 【COME WITH DROPPERS, EXCLUSIVE VALUE SET】4 droppers are very handy, easy to fill liquid into molds, especially for kids. If you don't like this product, please let us know and we will try our best to make things right. Any question please contact us, we will be replied within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pyniy9xsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAD DI","source_asin":"B0893FX9WL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0893FX9WL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0893FX9WL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":227883,"name":"Let’s Make Memories Personalized Merry Christmas from Heaven Christmas Ornament - Sympathy - Pewter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TQ0hKYkKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IN LOVING MEMORY: An elegant memorial Christmas ornament. They may not be here anymore, but they are still in your heart—and remembered at Christmas. This sympathy ornament will hold a place of honor on the tree this year and for years to come. UNIQUELY PERSONALIZED: Choose Pewter, Gold Plated or Pewter Photo. Customize the first 2 with any 2-line message up to 20 characters per line and memorial years, and the third with any name up to 18 characters, memorial years and a photo. ALWAYS IN YOUR HEART: Gone but not forgotten. This sentimental keepsake ornament is a heartfelt addition to any tree. The poem that appears on it is also printed on a card that is presented with the ornament in a gift box. PREMIUM QUALITY: Made of pewter or gold-plated, this beautifully crafted ornament measures 2.5”Lx2.875”W without photo and 3.25”Lx2.5”W with photo. Includes red ribbon for hanging. Imported for final manufacture locally. A GIFT OF REMEMBRANCE: Christmas is an excellent time to remember loved ones and friends no longer with us. This ornament is a thoughtful gift that is sure to have a special place on their tree and in their hearts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TQ0hKYkKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Let's Make Memories","source_asin":"B09DXNLYTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-227883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DXNLYTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DXNLYTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
